---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Harry Chang">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </section>

  <article class="post">
    <h2>關於我</h2>
    <p>Hi! 我是 Harry，</p>
    <p>喜歡與人互動，更喜歡追求各種新知，</p>
    <p>擅長架構規劃與設計，</p>
    <p>對敏捷也非常有熱情，正嘗試讓目前的團隊更敏捷!</p>

    <h2>認證</h2>
    <p><img src="/img/badge-7227.png" alt="PSM I badge" width="100" /></p>

    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>C#</li>
      <li>Asp.Net MVC, Web API 2, .Net Core</li>
      <li>Unit Test</li>
      <li>Clean Architecture</li>
      <li>Scrum</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
